1
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Proog: Emo, close your eyes! The cables overhead are shifting again inside the Machine.

2
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Emo: Proog, there is nothing chasing us. You're inventing walls in an empty room.

3
00:01:38,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Proog pulls Emo onto a narrow suspended catwalk surrounded by spinning brass gears and whistling steam pipes.

4
00:02:26,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Proog: Listen to the rhythm of the typewriter room. Every click holds the building together.

5
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:58,000
Mechanical telephone tendrils snap outward from the wall, forcing Proog to knock Emo backward onto the lift platform.

6
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:56,000
Emo: You don't see it, Proog—you're the only one locked inside this clockwork delusion!

7
00:05:12,000 --> 00:06:00,000
The catwalk fractures into floating silhouettes as Emo imagines giant elephants marching across the void.

8
00:06:16,000 --> 00:07:05,000
Proog strikes Emo with his cane to quiet the vision, leaving only the steady hum of the Machine in the dark.
